{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02637","headline":"赠学仙者 · 王绩","name":"赠学仙者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采药层城远，寻师海路赊。\n玉壶横日月，金阙断烟霞。\n仙人何处在？道士未还家。\n谁知彭泽意，更覔步兵那。\n春酿煎松叶，秋杯浸菊花。\n相逢宁可醉，定不学丹砂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}